# Pairs with NoTrimPastLiveNeed. A copy is discarded although its writes are still
# wanted - one a resize could still recover - so the deleted-tree hold retires its
# pins over writes it still needs.
MODULE: NoTrimPastLiveNeedDiscardKeepsWrites
TARGET: NoTrimPastLiveNeed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a copy whose writes are still wanted is discarded
PERTURBS: Discard

--- FIND
    /\ phase' = "discarded"
    /\ need' = {}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the copy is still wanted.
    /\ phase' = "discarded"
    /\ need' = need
--- END
